dotengine/godot/issues/108681","id":3145406764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67exks","user":{"login":"NateClarkTech","id":129341001,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7WWSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129341001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech","html_url":"https://github.com/NateClarkTech","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T18:25:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T18:25:16Z","body":"@cunyx \n\n> Nevertheless i tend to remember accessing the AssetLibrary from within openSUSE godot version 4.4.1 previously without crash. Can someone confirm?\n\nI can confirm that a week or two before I opened this issue that I was able to load the AssetLib and Export Template Manager without the engine crashing.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145406764/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145486593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108681#issuecomment-3145486593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1