     : libmbedtls21\nVersion     : 3.6.4\nRelease     : 1.1\nArchitecture: x86_64\nInstall Date: Sun 06 Jul 2025 14:15:35\nGroup       : Unspecified\nSize        : 355543\nLicense     : Apache-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-or-later\nSignature   : RSA/SHA512, Wed 02 Jul 2025 11:29:37, Key ID 35a2f86e29b700a4\nSource RPM  : mbedtls-3.6.4-1.1.src.rpm\nBuild Date  : Tue 01 Jul 2025 15:39:38\nBuild Host  : reproducible\nPackager    : https://bugs.opensuse.org\nVendor      : openSUSE\nURL         : https://tls.mbed.org\nSummary     : Transport Layer Security protocol suite\nDescription :\nmbedtls implements the SSL 3.0, TLS 1.0, 1.1 and 1.2 protocols. It\nsupports a number of extensions such as SSL Session Tickets (RFC\n5077), Server Name Indication (SNI) (RFC 6066), Truncated HMAC (RFC\n6066), Max Fragment Length (RFC 6066), Secure Renegotiation (RFC\n5746) and Application Layer Protocol Negotiation (ALPN). It\nunderstands the RSA, (EC)DH(E)-RSA, (EC)DH(E)-PSK and RSA-PSK key\nexchanges.\nDistribution: openSUSE Tumbleweed\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145647072/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145993852","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108681#issuecomment-3145993852","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108681","id":3145993852,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67hA58","user":{"login":"cunyx","id":38323421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzIzNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38323421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cunyx","html_url":"https://github.com/cunyx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cunyx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cunyx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http